le_name": "2023-01-26_16-34-26.mkv_snapshot_01.18.466_1440.png", "id": "3465087683770757", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974780_3465087687104090_5745773893023703044_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QuUmzWbRMZkQ7kNvwEqJVGY&_nc_oc=AdntESj_NphjhjG_UyWePhFgWofTe3BwkqCMy7oQSxZ8STl9IHe4IefziIcBUesV6Tw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyZoAfZHuJCp8UfLB_SRCaakb2gEL1b-nN0BuHDBJZNuw&oe=69B421E0"}, {"file_name": "2023-01-26_16-01-54.mkv_snapshot_00.25.826_1440.png", "id": "495260649347486", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974891_495260652680819_1612014108408918328_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QISspbcQGCwQ7kNvwEIYMrD&_nc_oc=Adnn1yp9cOwU3uAcN7iCihoCVc4ApRKh2aHUW3nVriULcnoj9JIbxtu5ECnAVgpkl1s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwTFebtXUDAUQu6HBNd8GeTG5ySZPKovzucZXZW-cGiiQ&oe=69B410C3"}, {"file_name": "2023-01-26_16-57-00.mkv_snapshot_01.20.540_1440.png", "id": "910860627004003", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974801_910860630337336_8867062962642311624_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DH_xX3N1t3AQ7kNvwE-4zRT&_nc_oc=AdkhQ790z6z_um6XJbVRWCD8mavgnQOM1m0bBp7y2eceUIRbTuftNDfkjhrHrp3flW8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw8JMz7G4ntNpoVvVbAqSbpDxdVjZRFCxI_w_UECcQerA&oe=69B4023F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Unification_release-trailer_thumbnail_quest.png", "id": "222585180139802", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003238_222585183473135_4209265122119070746_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Bz-nxQ7znjoQ7kNvwH-WEwd&_nc_oc=Adk1x9Oc8UY6Jgu_qXiuBEtvXeo0tzfjnxhE7zGXmE7MMBi5HUqv-GPpL_5A-1GG3do&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzulK_iDuTOXEPc110A4pGv6U8L4_HZOr2sJqYp5XQdnw&oe=69B3F5E5"}, "display_name": "Unification", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unification is a gravity-shifting VR parkour roguevania. Descend from the orbital factory into the layers of the black hole engine. Explore vibrant shifting architectures in a harmony of momentum and destruction... assuming you\u2019re able to overcome the traps and inhabitants in your path.\n\nFeatures:\n- Fluid and powerful physics-based movement: Feel momentum and the wind rushing past while leaping into chasms, vaulting over ledges, weaving around traps, and shifting gravity at will.\n- Kinetic tools propelling you forward: Swing above traps with a grappling hook, or glide past with a parachute. Go in guns blazing with a shotgun, or slice with a katana. Forge a new path with a jackhammer, or warp through with a teleporter.\n- Procedural destructible biomes filled with traps and enemies: Navigate through voxel cave obstacle courses with branching paths that test your reactions, knowledge, and control. Feel free to explore the depths and get lost. The handheld mini-map and conveniently placed teleporters make it easy to quickly get back on track.\n- Dreamlike upgrades: Push the limits of physics and imagination during the journey to the core with fundamental changes to the game mechanics\n- Carefully crafted controls and haptics: Each action is positioned on the controllers to allow effortless simultaneous usage of all movement and tool capabilities, inducing a flow state of control.", "short_description": "Unification is a gravity-shifting VR parkour roguevania. Descend from the orbital factory into the layers of the black hole engine. Explore vibrant shifting architectures in a harmony of momentum and destruction... assuming you\u2019re able to overcome the traps and inhabitants in your path."}]}, "developer_name": "Troy Spencer", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gist.github.com/troyspencer/7c0c9a0f5b23daf767866b9416a145fd", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CrushPoint Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://crushpo